---
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="Fairprice Meet the Fairmily | Justin Ho">
  <a href="/portfolio" class="back-link">← Back to Portfolio</a>

  <section class="project-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Editing</p>
    <h1>Fairprice Meet the Fairmily</h1>
    <p class="client">Client: NTUC Fairprice</p>
  </section>


<section class="video-section">
  <iframe
    src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1016003243"
    frameborder="0"
    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture"
    allowfullscreen>
  </iframe>
</section>

  <section class="project-details">
    <h2>Project Overview</h2>
    <p>
      A video editing project created as part of NTUC FairPrice's "Meet the Fairmily"
      outreach campaign, a scripted series designed to introduce the public to the
      people behind FairPrice and celebrate the individuals who keep the organisation
      running every day.
    </p>

    <p>
      Directed by Sabrina Poon, this episode was one of five videos produced for the
      first season of the series. Although the piece follows a documentary-style
      presentation, it was built from scripted scenes and performance-driven moments
      rather than interviews.
    </p>

    <p>
      As the editor, I focused on keeping the film pacy, clear and engaging through
      purposeful cuts, tight rhythm and careful selection of moments that preserved
      the personality of the featured employee while supporting the campaign's warm
      and approachable tone.
    </p>

<h2>Role</h2>

<ul>
  <li>Video Editing</li>
  <li>Story Structure & Narrative Development</li>
  <li>Pacing & Rhythm Design</li>
  <li>Music & Sound Integration</li>
  <li>Digital & Social Media Delivery</li>
</ul>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .back-link {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .project-hero {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 64px 0 40px;
  }

  .eyebrow,
  .client {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

    h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 16px 0;
    }

  .hero-image {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }

  .project-details {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .video-section {
  margin-bottom: 56px;
}

.video-section iframe {
  width: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 16px;
}
</style>